        "cooked": "<p>Swift Summoning</p>\n<p>Ongoing</p>\n<p>Power: Reveal the top Card of 1 Hero Deck. Play a card revealed this way. <strong>Discard any other revealed cards</strong>. If a one-shot is played this way, flip 1 arcane control token.</p>\n<p>Does this only apply if you have Applied Numerology in play which allows you to reveal 2 hero decks?</p>",
